<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47526" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tarrăco</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tarracon</span></b> , ōnis, f.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town in
			Spain</i>, now <i>Tarragona</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 3,
				4, § 21</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. Balb.
				11, 28</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 22, 22</span></i>. — Hence,
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tarrăcōnensis</span></b> , e,
				adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Tarraco</i>, <i>Tarraconian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conventus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					26, 19</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">colonia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					1, 78</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hispania,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. 3,
					1, 2, § 6</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">provincia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 3,
					1, 3, § 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vinum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					14, 6, 8, § 71</span></i>
			.</div>
